   "updated": 1791500000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Login flow",
   "originalText": "Login flow",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a4_110_6350",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1182,
   "width": 1035.0,
   "height": 75.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2122810036,
   "version": 2,
   "versionNonce": 1454211118,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1791500000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. UI opens /api/auth/login → Lambda stores a PKCE verifier in a short cookie and redirects to Cognito's hosted UI.\n2. Cognito redirects to /api/auth/callback?code=… → Lambda swaps code + verifier for tokens at Cognito.\n3. Lambda writes a row in sessions (SHA-256 of the id) and sets an HttpOnly __Host-session cookie.\n4. New accounts land in members as pending; the owner approves or rejects them in the UI.",
   "originalText": "1. UI opens /api/auth/login → Lambda stores a PKCE verifier in a short cookie and redirects to Cognito's hosted UI.\n2. Cognito redirects to /api/auth/callback?code=… → Lambda swaps code + verifier for tokens at Cognito.\n3. Lambda writes a row in sessions (SHA-256 of the id) and sets an HttpOnly __Host-session cookie.\n4. New accounts land in members as pending; the owner approves or rejects them in the UI.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a4_111_5237",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1300,
   "width": 504.0,
   "height": 25.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 20955502,
   "version": 2,
   "versionNonce": 724594628,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1791500000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Refresh flow (agent asks for fresh prices)",
   "originalText": "Refresh flow (agent asks for fresh prices)",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a4_112_1091",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1332,
   "width": 918.0,
   "height": 75.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1339244419,
   "version": 2,
   "versionNonce": 519488516,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1791500000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Agent calls request_refresh(product_ids) → refreshes row set to pending, returns at once.\n2. Scraper polls every 60 s, claims a batch (running), scrapes each site in parallel.\n3. Scraper writes prices and marks the refresh done or failed.\n4. Agent calls get_refresh_status(product_ids). The scraper may be offline, so pending can last hours.",
   "originalText": "1. Agent calls request_refresh(product_ids) → refreshes row set to pending, returns at once.\n2. Scraper polls every 60 s, claims a batch (running), scrapes each site in parallel.\n3. Scraper writes prices and marks the refresh done or failed.\n4. Agent calls get_refresh_status(product_ids). The scraper may be offline, so pending can last hours.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a4_113_9928",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1450,
   "width": 132.0,
   "height": 25.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 476048498,
   "version": 2,
   "versionNonce": 2089530331,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1791500000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "REST (/api)",
   "originalText": "REST (/api)",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
